    <string name="read2048_title">2048 — Read-only prototype</string>
    <string name="read2048_entry">2048 external test • read / move one step</string>
    <string name="read2048_instructions">Install the supplied 2048 Test APK and enable Accessibility. Start reading opens the game without touching it; swipe manually then return to compare the last confirmed board. Capture stops when leaving the test game or after two minutes. Only the supplied APK/default palette through 2048 is supported. Unknown images remain uncertain. No cloud calls or screenshot files. For one step, press Move once, allow full-display capture, and do not swipe manually. It chooses one legal direction, swipes once, checks a fresh result and stops. Return here to inspect; no automatic retry.</string>
